  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children&apos;s Christmas Calendar (Promotion and education material), 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gennem B&#xf8;rnenes U-landskalender aktiveres og engageres b&#xf8;rn og deres familier &#x2013; b&#xe5;de i skolen og derhjemme &#x2013; i udviklingsdagsordener og forhold for mennesker i udviklingslande. B&#xf8;rnenes U-landskalender skal fortsat udvikles og v&#xe6;re en kerneaktivitet i Udenrigsministeriets formidling til og engagement af b&#xf8;rn og b&#xf8;rnefamilier. 
Eng.: The purpose of the Children&#x2019;s Christmas Calendar is to engage children and their families in developmental issues &#x2013; in school and at home. The Children&#x2019;s Christmas Calendar will continue to expand and evolve as a key activity in the MFA&#x2019;s engagement efforts towards children and families.</narrative>
  </description>
